TI  - Influence of Temperature and Oxidation-Reduction Potential on Hydrolysis of Swine Manure Wastewater
AU  - the Department of Civil Engineering, Faculty of Engineering, Prince of Songkla University, Songkhla, 90112, Thailand
AU  - Chetawan, Worakan
